        "text": "=MASTER RESUME:\n{{ $('Extract from File').item.json.data }}\n\nJOB POSTING:\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nExplanation of fit: {{ $json.explanation }}\nRed flags: {{ $json.red_flags }}\n\nTASK:\nSelect and reword the most relevant bullets from the master resume \nfor this specific posting. Do NOT invent skills or experience not \npresent in the master resume.\n\nYou MUST include all three projects (project_1 through project_3), \neven if the third is a smaller supporting project. Never omit a field.\n\nReturn JSON:\n{\n  \"summary\": \"2-3 sentence tailored summary\",\n  \"project_1_title\": \"...\", \"project_1_description\": \"...\",\n  \"project_2_title\": \"...\", \"project_2_description\": \"...\",\n  \"project_3_title\": \"...\", \"project_3_description\": \"...\",\n  \"skills_list\": \"comma-separated relevant skills\"\n}\nAlso display the row number as in integer ",
